              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Amber Stoltenberg"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this and I love it! I did adjust it a little tho. I used a 1/3 cup oil instead of 1/2. I added a little bit of basil. And I used dried minced onion instead of fresh. I also used 4 tomatoes instead of 3. It tasted fantastic!!! I will definitely make it again.",
