            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "cindylouwho"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I LOVE this salad! I always have a bundle of cherry tomatoes from my garden in the summer and love making this salad with them. I add cucumbers and bocconcini to it and have it for lunch!",
            "datePublished": "2019-07-14T18:24:06.560Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Saveur"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Absolutely loved this tomato salad! What a great , simple summer side. I used 1/4 cup oil, and did double the mustard. This makes plenty of dressing, easily enough for six tomatoes. I used orange, yellow, and red tomatoes, so pretty. Thanks for sharing your recipe, Jay!",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-27T06:11:47.653Z"
          },
          {
