            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lisa"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was FABULOUS! I used red onion(about 1/2 of a lg onion), white wine vinegar, &amp; grape tomatoes cut in 1/2. I can't rave enough about this! It was a HUGE hit this weekend!",
            "datePublished": "2011-09-12T07:22:37.763Z"
